Set<String> names = new HashSet<>();
for (int m = 0; m < CI.memberSize(); m++) names.add(CI.memberName(m));
>>>
check <<<
assertEquals(names.size(), ids.length);
for (int k = 1; k < ids.length; k++) assertTrue(ids[k - 1] < ids[k], "strictly ascending ids");
>>>

